OL,3,GNEWSA'I've had three livers, now I'm
OL,4,Arunning a marathon'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who received three liver
OL,7,Ftransplants, including one donated by
OL,8,Fhis father, is training to run the
OL,9,FLondon Marathon as he campaigns for
OL,10,Fgreater awareness of organ donation.
OL,12,FCharlie Tobey, 25, from Woolhope,
OL,13,FHerefordshire, had his first transplant
OL,14,Fat just two weeks old and later needed
OL,15,Ftwo more operations following
OL,16,Fcomplications as a teenager.
OL,18,FNow living and working in London, he is
OL,19,Fone of five runners hoping to raise
OL,20,F#15,000 for Split - Children's Liver
OL,21,FFund, a charity he helped establish
OL,22,Fafter his third transplant in 2015.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
